msgid ""
"Built on the Chromium Embedded Framework. Karere 4.0 replaces the WebKitGTK "
"backend with the Chromium Embedded Framework, bringing full video attachment "
"playback (H.264/AAC), multi-account support with isolated sessions, per-"
"account zoom, and a faster, more compatible rendering engine while keeping "
"the same native GTK4/libadwaita shell."
msgstr ""
"Nou gebou op CEF/Chromium 148. Karere 4.0 vervang die WebKitGTK-agterkant "
"met die Chromium Embedded Framework, wat volledige video-aanhegsel-afspeel "
"(H.264/AAC), multirekening-ondersteuning met geïsoleerde sessies, per-"
"rekening-zoem en 'n vinniger, meer versoenbare uitvoerenjin bring terwyl "
"dieselfde inheemse GTK4/libadwaita-dop behou word."

